  "question": {
    "text": "Three forces start acting simultaneously on a particle moving with velocity, $\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{v}}$. These forces are represented in magnitude and direction by the three sides of a triangle $\\mathrm{ABC}$. The particle will now move with velocity\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/nBW_oRWA_TMe2xZGrEMKslO-2QZxSbcyWRjDl1VzfiY.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
